# lib_playground, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib): Elm's
# architecture (core/: Cmd, Sub...), the shapes (Playground), the
# random numbers and the layers (camera, sprites, tiles). Its other
# parts are libraries of their own, after the ones they stand on:
# juice/ (over nothing), physics/ (after lib_graphics), apis/ (after
# physics/, lib_gui, lib_audio, juice/, netcode, lib_ai),
# platforms/ and each platform (platforms/ppm...).
TOP=..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=lib_playground
DIRS=core random . layers
NEEDS=lib_graphics
UNITS=Basics Cmd Color Set Time Lehmer Audio_source Sub Playground Camera2d Scene2d Sprite Tilemap
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
